FILE_DESCRIPTION(('Original Bourns_SMBJ-Q_DO-214AA model | SPDX-License-Identifier: CERN-OHL-P-2.0 | Copyright 2026 Gerhard Malberg | Source: https://www.bourns.com/docs/product-datasheets/smbj-q.pdf | DO-214AA (SMB) JEDEC registered outline, dimensions from the Vishay SMB outline drawing document 95401: body 4.06-4.57 x 3.30-3.94, height 1.95-2.20 on a 0-0.20 standoff, overall lead span 5.21-5.59, foot 0.76-1.52 long x 2.13-2.44 wide, terminal thickness 0.152-0.305. Modelled at the drawing maxima, the conservative choice for clearance. Moulded epoxy body with tin-plated leads, cathode band at the pin 1 end'),'2;1');
